## Supporting Files

- `visualization-base.css` — Mandatory CSS embedded by the generator
- `scripts/intake-server.py` — Local topic form
- `scripts/harvest-sources.py` — Academic API harvest
- `scripts/classify-claims.py` — Claude API stance classification + cache
- `scripts/generate-dossier.py` — HTML dossier builder
- `data/seed-debates.json` — Debate Arena “commonly misunderstood” starter rooms

## Example Invocation

- "Run Pineapple 71717"
- "Find research materials on …"
- "Literature scan for my thesis on …"
- "Run Pineapple 71717 on the example request"

## Built-in Example

If the user wants to try the skill without live APIs, use `example/` at the project root. Open `example/dossier.html` directly, or regenerate from the committed JSON fixtures.
